OL,3,GNEWSA'Time to say goodbye' as announcer
OL,4,Ahangs up mic
OL,5,
OL,6,FBroadcaster John Dalziel, known to
OL,7,Fgenerations of fans as JD, is stepping
OL,8,Fdown as Coventry City FC's matchday
OL,9,Fannouncer after 25 years.
OL,11,FThe presenter revealed he was also
OL,12,Fhanging up the microphone at Coventry
OL,13,FBlaze after 23 years, having accepted a
OL,14,Fradio job in the United Arab Emirates.
OL,16,FFighting back tears, JD told BBC CWR he
OL,17,Fwould leave for Dubai on Thursday on a
OL,18,Fone-way ticket.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
