OL,3,GNEWSA'Time to say goodbye' as announcer
OL,4,Ahangs up mic
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just want to thank the city for the
OL,7,Fopportunities, giving me, an Aldermoor
OL,8,Fkid who just wanted to be on a
OL,9,Fmicrophone, the chance to do it in so
OL,10,Fmany ways ` I will be forever
OL,11,Fgrateful."
